OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,FManchester City boss Enzo Maresca has
OL,7,Fput the ball firmly in Omar Marmoush's
OL,8,Fcourt regarding the striker's future
OL,9,Fat the club.
OL,11,FMarmoush, 27, has found Premier League
OL,12,Fstarts hard to come by since his
OL,13,Farrival from Eintracht Frankfurt in
OL,14,FJanuary 2025, making just 22 starts
OL,15,Fand 15 appearances off the bench.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
