CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1787415273
OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,FDespite netting 10 league goals, the
OL,7,FEgyptian international has largely
OL,8,Fplayed second fiddle to Erling
OL,9,FHaaland, a situation that does not
OL,10,Flook set to change under City's new
OL,11,Fmanager.
OL,13,FMarmoush reminded City fans of his
OL,14,Fquality with a brace in Sunday's 3-1
OL,15,Ffriendly win over Atletico Madrid in
OL,16,FSeoul.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,370,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1787415273
OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,FBut when asked after the match whether
OL,7,FMarmoush would remain at the Etihad,
OL,8,FMaresca compared the situation to that
OL,9,Fof goalkeeper James Trafford, who
OL,10,Frecently joined Leeds after struggling
OL,11,Ffor regular football.
OL,13,FCity's new boss Maresca said: "Players
OL,14,Fwork every day, they want to play so
OL,15,Fwhen they don't play they are not
OL,16,Fhappy,
OL,26,@uD@_OU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
