PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1787415273
OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,F"Omar did not play a lot last year so
OL,7,Fhis desire is probably to play more
OL,8,Fminutes. It doesn't mean that he isn't
OL,9,Fgoing to play more minutes here but
OL,10,Fit's also his decision, and he needs
OL,11,Fto decide."
OL,13,FCity have been without several big
OL,14,Fnames on their pre-season trip to
OL,15,FAsia, with Haaland, Rodri, Rayan
OL,16,FCherki, and England stars Elliot
OL,17,FAnderson, Marc Guehi, and Nico
OL,18,FO'Reilly all missing out due to World
OL,19,FCup commitments.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
