PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F369A1787415273
OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,FStill, Maresca is pleased with his
OL,7,Fsquad's attitude and progress.
OL,9,FHe said: "I'm very happy. Especially
OL,10,Fbecause the players, since we started,
OL,11,Fhave been open-minded.
OL,13,F"They want to understand and want to
OL,14,Flearn why we do things. The most
OL,15,Fimportant thing is we are getting
OL,16,Fbetter. The path is a huge path to
OL,17,Fimprove things.
OL,19,F"But I can see we are trying what we
OL,20,Fdo in training, and we are getting
OL,21,Fbetter at that."
OL,26,@qD@JOU}D@PO]
