OL,3,CCity's Maresca says Marmoush's future
OL,4,C'up to the striker'
OL,6,FWhether Marmoush stays to fight for
OL,7,Fhis spot or seeks more regular
OL,8,Ffootball elsewhere remains to be seen,
OL,9,Fbut Maresca made it clear the decision
OL,10,Fis in the player's hands.
